From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 18:51:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Remove outbound network connections

- Remove GitHub update checker (api.github.com), its setting toggle and
  "New version!" menu
- Remove startup fetch of losslesscut.mifi.no/config.json and the
  iframe banner on the start screen
- Remove store-build app path/title reporting to
  losslesscut-analytics.mifi.no
- Remove GPS track map (OpenStreetMap tiles) and its now-unused
  parsers, tests and dependencies (leaflet, react-leaflet, @octokit/core)

Fork-Change: 03-no-network
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014r72Ms4f4YPmzcdb6AJxQK
